NAME
       gbild - GTK+ 2 image viewer

SYNOPSIS
       gbild [-f] [file] ...

DESCRIPTION
       gbild is a GTK+ 2 image viewer.

OPTIONS
       -f	Start in full-screen mode.

OPERANDS
	file
		Image file to open.

EXIT STATUS
	0	The program exited successfully.
	1	An error occurred.

SEE ALSO
	None.
